# Paths allowed to still name a retired `/gaia-wiki sync` style stage invocation
# (a stage name, a `[sync|consolidate|lint]` menu, a `<stage>` placeholder, or an
# `(any sub-command)` note after the command). One repo-relative path or glob
# per line. Used by .gaia/tests/lib/wiki-stage-args-retired.bats, which also
# fails on an entry that matches no hit, so the list never grows stale.
#
# History that is never rewritten.
CHANGELOG.md
wiki/meta/**
# The guard and this list.
.gaia/tests/lib/wiki-stage-args-retired.bats
.gaia/tests/fixtures/wiki-stage-args-retired.allowlist
